WEBVTT

cue_gap_000
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.594
A young person in light clothes lies prone on a metal platform. An older man with white hair struggles nearby, hunched over as a brilliant, fractured light beam pulses intensely in the background.

cue_gap_010
00:00:33.024 --> 00:00:38.384
The figures now stand on the intricate platform, surrounded by glowing wires.

cue_gap_011
00:00:39.304 --> 00:01:00.000
Two luminous figures, an older, hunched man in a jacket and a younger person behind him, emerge from a blindingly bright opening.
